  "title": "Display Pictures as Face Graphics [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "ピクチャを顔グラとして表示【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "f7c7053fdd4e82b18d6a000b017b54af43d58ce4a0de2ea9ef2d22da374028b3",
      "translation": "Display Pictures as Face Graphics [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "f7c7053fdd4e82b18d6a000b017b54af43d58ce4a0de2ea9ef2d22da374028b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを顔グラとしてそのまま使用できるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "be5a95d9bb93395c78ccec04a1c25bede3237153f89ca54a64573be89bd85dfb",
      "translation": "Allows pictures to be used directly as face graphics.",
      "contextHash": "be5a95d9bb93395c78ccec04a1c25bede3237153f89ca54a64573be89bd85dfb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "このプラグインは立ち絵用のピクチャから、いちいち顔グラを別ファイルとして切り抜くのが面倒になった作者が、作業を省略するために作ったものです。",
      "sourceHash": "e8c1f5dac7e1a60702e5205c8701bd09da4a44565e937c9c4d8af23002ef1765",
      "translation": "I created this plugin to save time after finding it tedious to repeatedly crop face graphics from pictures intended for character portraits.",
      "contextHash": "e8c1f5dac7e1a60702e5205c8701bd09da4a44565e937c9c4d8af23002ef1765"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "一応、メッセージの顔グラにも対応していますが、基本的にはメニュー画面などに表示されるアクター用です。",
      "sourceHash": "a0a15f9684701106bd96c8d7635b039007ce1d1b33f53037a82d46745abbd82f",
      "translation": "It also supports message face graphics, but it is primarily intended for actors displayed on screens such as the menu screen.",
      "contextHash": "a0a15f9684701106bd96c8d7635b039007ce1d1b33f53037a82d46745abbd82f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "具体的には顔グラのファイルとピクチャを紐づけることで、ピクチャを144x144のサイズの顔グラとして表示します。",
      "sourceHash": "dc28cf585ca661b3c328deb521bd84df9290cef242a7cd5a95eb895c95b38039",
      "translation": "Specifically, by linking face graphic files to pictures, it displays the pictures as 144x144 face graphics.",
      "contextHash": "dc28cf585ca661b3c328deb521bd84df9290cef242a7cd5a95eb895c95b38039"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※なお、顔グラのパターンは参照しません。１キャラクター＝１ファイルとしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "a945f060b6f1ff70d840d0e5ddbc71d9d5c5e721639f48e4685754763a4d9511",
      "translation": "※Face graphic patterns are not referenced. Use one file per character.",
      "contextHash": "a945f060b6f1ff70d840d0e5ddbc71d9d5c5e721639f48e4685754763a4d9511"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※MZ ver1.9.0より、システム2で顔サイズを指定できるようになりました。",
      "sourceHash": "36f7a1a9466663c4f5d650c87a6e231d50f10ea9503feec208d70b39697c1fdd",
      "translation": "※As of MZ ver1.9.0, you can specify the face graphic size in System 2.",
      "contextHash": "36f7a1a9466663c4f5d650c87a6e231d50f10ea9503feec208d70b39697c1fdd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Enable the plugin in the Plugin Manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_PictureToFace.js",
      "sourceHash": "136433908c316db40041171d795e358e6ef4e00518903ce7d9aa4a5ee404f40a",
      "translation": "NRP_PictureToFace.js ",
      "contextHash": "9e13546f5cf12cc0852c45fc05d1226971890c805eafc1049531f77643c9d9ba"
    },
