    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『ピクチャリスト』の『顔グラ』に置換元となるファイルを設定し、置換先となるピクチャと紐づけてください。",
      "sourceHash": "86dd22f99726c222b8468fa07840f8927c9e979c1392d82fd76ae3e8d3835afe",
      "translation": "Set the file to be replaced under “Face” in “PictureList,” and link it to the picture to replace it with.",
      "contextHash": "86dd22f99726c222b8468fa07840f8927c9e979c1392d82fd76ae3e8d3835afe"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "Ｘ座標補正、Ｙ座標補正、拡大率を設定し、切り抜く位置を調整してください。",
      "sourceHash": "91aa3c1d605831fe2245a94171f525257aaf4172bb6fe055e8076963ba125768",
      "translation": "Set AdjustX, AdjustY, and Scale to adjust the cropping position.",
      "contextHash": "91aa3c1d605831fe2245a94171f525257aaf4172bb6fe055e8076963ba125768"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "条件について（About Conditions）",
      "sourceHash": "93ad634104c972cb2855b5ef19f265ead262ea971ce3b5314ebf755d08a04855",
      "translation": "About Conditions (About Conditions)",
      "contextHash": "93ad634104c972cb2855b5ef19f265ead262ea971ce3b5314ebf755d08a04855"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "スイッチやスクリプトを条件とすることで、状況によって参照するピクチャを変更できます。",
      "sourceHash": "7fe90e4a9ad8a9164c3560fdaceae39c3769ca045713c9b3f935180e93db2e75",
      "translation": "You can change the picture referenced depending on the situation by using a switch or script as a condition.",
      "contextHash": "7fe90e4a9ad8a9164c3560fdaceae39c3769ca045713c9b3f935180e93db2e75"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、スクリプト条件に「a.isDead()」と設定すれば、戦闘不能時のみ表示を変更させることができます。",
      "sourceHash": "e604b211c609ab2bd2870fa8386d02027bcce8d658ff5f5cf7db2f47fb6a35d6",
      "translation": "For example, setting “a.isDead()” as the script condition changes the display only when the actor is incapacitated.",
      "contextHash": "e604b211c609ab2bd2870fa8386d02027bcce8d658ff5f5cf7db2f47fb6a35d6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ただし、場面によっては、a（battler）の情報を取得できないため、反映されない可能性があります。",
      "sourceHash": "424e8433a75bb2082cb23f4bb7b85ab34b2076879fbe77661342bf99cca73b2f",
      "translation": "However, depending on the scene, the information for a (battler) may not be available, so the change may not be applied.",
      "contextHash": "424e8433a75bb2082cb23f4bb7b85ab34b2076879fbe77661342bf99cca73b2f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ピクチャリスト（PictureList）",
      "sourceHash": "df71b3a1c97ed3baf1b14eba1d61299564f45a7aee0954094a8e821aae818aac",
      "translation": "PictureList (PictureList)",
      "contextHash": "df71b3a1c97ed3baf1b14eba1d61299564f45a7aee0954094a8e821aae818aac"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "立ち絵の表示を行うピクチャの一覧です。",
      "sourceHash": "4839b913cdea73f3e5134c799764b375f94ad6a934ae0a23d8904317d36953e7",
      "translation": "A list of pictures used to display character portraits.",
      "contextHash": "4839b913cdea73f3e5134c799764b375f94ad6a934ae0a23d8904317d36953e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "原点（Origin）",
      "sourceHash": "95561f3300073372475f2c8cf85e7f9a77e69af2830ba00da97b98e7033d93f1",
      "translation": "Origin (Origin)",
      "contextHash": "95561f3300073372475f2c8cf85e7f9a77e69af2830ba00da97b98e7033d93f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを表示する原点です。",
      "sourceHash": "c591e6dce5a399fa10400e923f6986054739684446cfb46d48458758c09ae8a0",
      "translation": "The origin for displaying pictures.",
      "contextHash": "c591e6dce5a399fa10400e923f6986054739684446cfb46d48458758c09ae8a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｘ座標補正（AdjustX）",
      "sourceHash": "dcfc08d6da2067f3bac9df8ab569ab14bcad5e8f3001faf2e5d040a9241edc22",
      "translation": "AdjustX (AdjustX)",
      "contextHash": "dcfc08d6da2067f3bac9df8ab569ab14bcad5e8f3001faf2e5d040a9241edc22"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを切り取るＸ座標を調整します。",
      "sourceHash": "d414842c26d0f8cfd7be13256871090ae5f4d796791ba8e1ed3e048692b685d4",
      "translation": "Adjusts the X coordinate at which the picture is cropped.",
      "contextHash": "d414842c26d0f8cfd7be13256871090ae5f4d796791ba8e1ed3e048692b685d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｙ座標補正（AdjustY）",
      "sourceHash": "4bf807a717d1d7895fc85e091711954140d72451defa384742ab2c4a6f1cae9e",
      "translation": "AdjustY (AdjustY)",
      "contextHash": "4bf807a717d1d7895fc85e091711954140d72451defa384742ab2c4a6f1cae9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを切り取るＹ座標を調整します。",
      "sourceHash": "b11d0d7e5dad9b9a33d2154e55ce9f328547e2ec07b160b7f1c79a0eb14248da",
      "translation": "Adjusts the Y coordinate at which the picture is cropped.",
      "contextHash": "b11d0d7e5dad9b9a33d2154e55ce9f328547e2ec07b160b7f1c79a0eb14248da"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "拡大率（Scale）",
      "sourceHash": "355c6f03a83a431fd149b53b21f98433ed5cdff14c07881cd809a5295dda6a31",
      "translation": "Scale (Scale)",
      "contextHash": "355c6f03a83a431fd149b53b21f98433ed5cdff14c07881cd809a5295dda6a31"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "標準となるピクチャの拡大率です。",
      "sourceHash": "82fc296c7cbe2718e6137d60b613cb51bb1f51e780e8238b345b59ebdd6ef6d8",
      "translation": "The default scale for pictures.",
      "contextHash": "82fc296c7cbe2718e6137d60b613cb51bb1f51e780e8238b345b59ebdd6ef6d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "100を基準に設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "995108f2823f974353957e798bc083f2fae1c637d6c3221033a84531de8bc4b9",
      "translation": "Set it based on 100.",
      "contextHash": "995108f2823f974353957e798bc083f2fae1c637d6c3221033a84531de8bc4b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "顔グラの横幅（FaceWidth）",
      "sourceHash": "52ee7444bf870520c62f500a14a1441659bbf618d0e908c57f9bdad548420437",
      "translation": "Face Width (FaceWidth)",
      "contextHash": "52ee7444bf870520c62f500a14a1441659bbf618d0e908c57f9bdad548420437"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "表示される顔グラの横幅です。",
      "sourceHash": "83500ef5a1fa963c8aba98566d39b4d727368604bb36d8b03406ff620300ab0d",
      "translation": "The width of the displayed face graphic.",
      "contextHash": "83500ef5a1fa963c8aba98566d39b4d727368604bb36d8b03406ff620300ab0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄ならシステム2の設定値を参照します。",
      "sourceHash": "894260c23757d380ef9dba6a09c3735e7a50756e96710992f9c040f9f0a8f22b",
      "translation": "If left blank, the value set in System 2 is used.",
      "contextHash": "894260c23757d380ef9dba6a09c3735e7a50756e96710992f9c040f9f0a8f22b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "顔グラの縦幅（FaceHeight）",
      "sourceHash": "8eaebce0e6097883df20fcf942f519c1c4561266e0527936f0c778419444fea0",
      "translation": "Face Height (FaceHeight)",
      "contextHash": "8eaebce0e6097883df20fcf942f519c1c4561266e0527936f0c778419444fea0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "表示される顔グラの縦幅です。",
      "sourceHash": "24dbd86ff3389230a258a198aeebd8c4b3696ae0560be138849bd3356e7b8446",
      "translation": "The height of the displayed face graphic.",
      "contextHash": "24dbd86ff3389230a258a198aeebd8c4b3696ae0560be138849bd3356e7b8446"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄ならシステム2の設定値を参照します。",
      "sourceHash": "894260c23757d380ef9dba6a09c3735e7a50756e96710992f9c040f9f0a8f22b",
      "translation": "If left blank, the value set in System 2 is used.",
      "contextHash": "894260c23757d380ef9dba6a09c3735e7a50756e96710992f9c040f9f0a8f22b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（ピクチャ）（Plugin Parameters Picture）",
      "sourceHash": "eb9eefe548c395ff9d8017775e469f75108e31205b74231608aeac11e54d1a05",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Picture) (Plugin Parameters Picture)",
      "contextHash": "eb9eefe548c395ff9d8017775e469f75108e31205b74231608aeac11e54d1a05"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "こちらはピクチャ毎の設定です。",
      "sourceHash": "a0255cb6490510c61c5df247f09f53dc82b46d1a7de127e1ca647dff42318a03",
      "translation": "These are settings for each picture.",
      "contextHash": "a0255cb6490510c61c5df247f09f53dc82b46d1a7de127e1ca647dff42318a03"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄にした項目は共通の設定がそのまま引き継がれます。",
      "sourceHash": "caa4b79be2d61832ed18e6e2f2a4aac58d6d1122a1a26387d85350f076cd25d2",
      "translation": "Any fields left blank inherit the corresponding common settings.",
      "contextHash": "caa4b79be2d61832ed18e6e2f2a4aac58d6d1122a1a26387d85350f076cd25d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "顔グラ（Face）",
      "sourceHash": "776183fa925786e3e7c3343792228a9da569116f7faecae8f9c7174211339ffa",
      "translation": "Face (Face)",
      "contextHash": "776183fa925786e3e7c3343792228a9da569116f7faecae8f9c7174211339ffa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "置換対象とする顔グラのファイルです。",
      "sourceHash": "e54734314faf969b06b56cda99a029193d778a4ba33a971fcffc542371f2ff12",
      "translation": "The face graphic file to be replaced.",
      "contextHash": "e54734314faf969b06b56cda99a029193d778a4ba33a971fcffc542371f2ff12"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ピクチャ（Picture）",
      "sourceHash": "37229cdac3dac67e0fd2dd2ecda64f20f85cd1cc28bd86be0a0e755e3479c6d3",
      "translation": "Picture (Picture)",
      "contextHash": "37229cdac3dac67e0fd2dd2ecda64f20f85cd1cc28bd86be0a0e755e3479c6d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "置換先のピクチャです。",
      "sourceHash": "40c6c70d2d5a52fc2bd28fcad5182f51f1b7c15378c981afb47ec8c0532d1149",
      "translation": "The picture to replace it with.",
      "contextHash": "40c6c70d2d5a52fc2bd28fcad5182f51f1b7c15378c981afb47ec8c0532d1149"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スイッチ（Switch）",
      "sourceHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78",
      "translation": "Switch (Switch)",
      "contextHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "表示を有効にするスイッチです。",
      "sourceHash": "eb23a48c4799568f62752b77979449fb3e87deaa2a05073acd482be6fe1e2134",
      "translation": "The switch that enables the display.",
      "contextHash": "eb23a48c4799568f62752b77979449fb3e87deaa2a05073acd482be6fe1e2134"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "条件を満たした中で最も上の設定が表示されます。",
      "sourceHash": "fd0edfb0458aaec72bf8079b8757bbc8d307fef5e8cce6d60d214a86119b089d",
      "translation": "Among the conditions that are met, the highest setting in the list is displayed.",
      "contextHash": "fd0edfb0458aaec72bf8079b8757bbc8d307fef5e8cce6d60d214a86119b089d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-020",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スクリプト条件（ScriptCondition）",
      "sourceHash": "6380ad6048950ab4bd983af99d71453a9ef81d4239d6f9f14acf4a6aec58e60f",
      "translation": "Script Condition (ScriptCondition)",
      "contextHash": "6380ad6048950ab4bd983af99d71453a9ef81d4239d6f9f14acf4a6aec58e60f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "表示を有効にするスクリプトです。",
      "sourceHash": "83f2bd1e75926a069dc407eec0f069795027b4c97ed3071b384cce04bd678c5e",
      "translation": "This is a script that enables display.",
      "contextHash": "83f2bd1e75926a069dc407eec0f069795027b4c97ed3071b384cce04bd678c5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-032",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例：a.isDead()",
      "sourceHash": "f106ebdcf71df70bdce3e8564e991b3a134090b127ae8ecd44afe9119a5fb3b9",
      "translation": "Example: a.isDead()",
      "contextHash": "f106ebdcf71df70bdce3e8564e991b3a134090b127ae8ecd44afe9119a5fb3b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-021",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "原点（Origin）",
      "sourceHash": "95561f3300073372475f2c8cf85e7f9a77e69af2830ba00da97b98e7033d93f1",
      "translation": "Origin (Origin)",
      "contextHash": "95561f3300073372475f2c8cf85e7f9a77e69af2830ba00da97b98e7033d93f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-033",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを表示する原点です。",
      "sourceHash": "c591e6dce5a399fa10400e923f6986054739684446cfb46d48458758c09ae8a0",
      "translation": "This is the origin for displaying pictures.",
      "contextHash": "c591e6dce5a399fa10400e923f6986054739684446cfb46d48458758c09ae8a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-022",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｘ座標調整（AdjustX）",
      "sourceHash": "9c2a6f117215ab258fe78e842c89e7f50068379e23d3d47621ed379cce98d94c",
      "translation": "X Coordinate Adjustment (AdjustX)",
      "contextHash": "9c2a6f117215ab258fe78e842c89e7f50068379e23d3d47621ed379cce98d94c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-034",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを切り取るＸ座標を調整します。",
      "sourceHash": "d414842c26d0f8cfd7be13256871090ae5f4d796791ba8e1ed3e048692b685d4",
      "translation": "Adjusts the X coordinate at which the picture is cropped.",
      "contextHash": "d414842c26d0f8cfd7be13256871090ae5f4d796791ba8e1ed3e048692b685d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-035",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "値を設定した場合は共通の設定に対して、さらに値が加算されます。",
      "sourceHash": "74bbea278fdb1e688770b48b15741f172a8094bae2b2468f49c50a96ed7056e3",
      "translation": "When a value is set, it is added to the common setting.",
      "contextHash": "74bbea278fdb1e688770b48b15741f172a8094bae2b2468f49c50a96ed7056e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-023",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｙ座標調整（AdjustY）",
      "sourceHash": "1ba3cb850888c214f319f1680dd3dbd6d54a5b3305a6084066369243d4fa8242",
      "translation": "Y Coordinate Adjustment (AdjustY)",
      "contextHash": "1ba3cb850888c214f319f1680dd3dbd6d54a5b3305a6084066369243d4fa8242"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-036",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャを切り取るＹ座標を調整します。",
      "sourceHash": "b11d0d7e5dad9b9a33d2154e55ce9f328547e2ec07b160b7f1c79a0eb14248da",
      "translation": "Adjusts the Y coordinate at which the picture is cropped.",
      "contextHash": "b11d0d7e5dad9b9a33d2154e55ce9f328547e2ec07b160b7f1c79a0eb14248da"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-037",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "値を設定した場合は共通の設定に対して、さらに値が加算されます。",
      "sourceHash": "74bbea278fdb1e688770b48b15741f172a8094bae2b2468f49c50a96ed7056e3",
      "translation": "When a value is set, it is added to the common setting.",
      "contextHash": "74bbea278fdb1e688770b48b15741f172a8094bae2b2468f49c50a96ed7056e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-024",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "拡大率（Scale）",
      "sourceHash": "355c6f03a83a431fd149b53b21f98433ed5cdff14c07881cd809a5295dda6a31",
      "translation": "Scale (Scale)",
      "contextHash": "355c6f03a83a431fd149b53b21f98433ed5cdff14c07881cd809a5295dda6a31"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-038",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ピクチャの拡大率です。",
      "sourceHash": "a690dc2d36b0775fd687cce869ccd658cb1215c4060137e2b4807f06c65e2392",
      "translation": "This is the picture's scale.",
      "contextHash": "a690dc2d36b0775fd687cce869ccd658cb1215c4060137e2b4807f06c65e2392"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-039",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "100を基準に設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "995108f2823f974353957e798bc083f2fae1c637d6c3221033a84531de8bc4b9",
      "translation": "Set it relative to 100.",
      "contextHash": "995108f2823f974353957e798bc083f2fae1c637d6c3221033a84531de8bc4b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-040",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "値を設定した場合は共通の設定を無視して上書きします。",
      "sourceHash": "46ec576a2627901a7806a0e2f3a8f486b9bb7e73cc1664cc0ee5e38698f981b2",
      "translation": "When a value is set, it overrides the common setting.",
      "contextHash": "46ec576a2627901a7806a0e2f3a8f486b9bb7e73cc1664cc0ee5e38698f981b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-041",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "座標調整とは挙動が異なるのでご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "dd5e2dfd953e643a03cfd3e311cc0f10286629addcce1161788b7d567091b74c",
      "translation": "Please note that its behavior differs from coordinate adjustment.",
      "contextHash": "dd5e2dfd953e643a03cfd3e311cc0f10286629addcce1161788b7d567091b74c"
    }
  ],
